    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000s9cg](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000s9cg) Magnitude 6.0 earthquake at 108.831 depth occurred on Apr 01 2026 4km SE of Shamboyacu. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.0558 longitude -76.1241. It impacted 81860 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
